  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">(사례1)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">사교성이 좋고 성격이 활달하여 인간관계를 잘 맺고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">남녀 모든 학생들과 폭넓은 교우관계를 유지함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">어려운 친구를 잘 도와주고 맡은 일에 책임감이 강한 학생임</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">분위기 메이커로 활기찬 학급 분위기를 만들고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">다른 학생들의 집중력이 떨어질 때 밝은 분위기로 수업할 수 있도록 유도함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">순발력이 좋아 체육활동에서 두각을 나타내었으며</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학교스포츠클럽 발야구대회에서 남다른 승부욕으로 팀승리에 크게 기여함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">중요한 학급 행사마다 친구들을 잘 이끌며 현장체험학습의 장소나 의견 등을 수렴하고 조율하는 역할을 함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학기 학급자치 회장을 하였고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학기 때도 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학기 학급자치 회장을 잘 이끌어주며 뒤에서 많은 도움을 주었고 반별 행사가 있을 때에도 친구들과 같이 합의를 통해서 결정하고 해결하는 주도성을 보임.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">(사례2)</span></p><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">원만한 성격에 경청하는 자세를 갖고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">대인관계 능력이 좋고 협력적인 태도를 지녀 긍정적인 학급 구성원으로서 학급에서 맡은 역할에 책임을 다함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">개인의 이익보다는 공동체를 우선시하는 태도를 지님</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">밝은 성격으로 친구들에게 항상 친절하게 대해주고 학습에서 도움이 필요한 친구들을 많이 도와주며 수업 시간에도 열정적으로 참여함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">독서에 관심이 많아 독서마라톤 행사에 주도적으로 참여하여 다독 우수자로 선정됨</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학업 면에도 노력하여 자발적인 스터디그룹을 만들어서 저녁마다 꾸준히 공부 모임을 운영해 함께 성장하고자 노력함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">(사례3)</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">스스로 계획을 세워 실천하는 자기 관리 능력이 우수하고 빈틈이 없으며</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학업성적 향상을 위해 최선을 다함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">조용한 편이지만 학교의 다양한 활동 및 행사에 적극적으로 참여하는 진취적인 모습을 보임</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">스포츠 클럽 대회에서 본인이 갖고 있는 최대한의 운동능력을 발휘하려고 노력함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">급식 도우미 활동</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">봉사활동</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학교 푸르미 봉사활동에 참여하는 등 봉사활동에도 성실하게 참여함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">틈틈이 사회</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">건축</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">도시 관련 책을 즐겨 읽으며 현재 도시가 갖고 있는 문제점</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">건축 및  설계의 대안들을 모색해보는 것을 즐김</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">특히 자발적으로 도시 환경에 대한 탐구주제를 정해서 이를 연구보고서로 작성하는 등 도시건축에 남다른 관심이 큼</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">사례를 살펴보시고,</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">개선할 사항 알려주시면 </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">초보 담임에게 큰 도움이 됩니다!</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">따끔한 한 말씀 기다리고 있겠습니다~</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
